	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Helman'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　Planned City Cossack'
	\L_00f16:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　Helman 4th Army HQ'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Command Room'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'The 4th Army general was'
	R
	'explaining a strategy to his'
	R
	'subordinates.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'Then let’s begin the'
	R
	'counterattack. This time we’ll'
	R
	'absolutely obliterate the'
	R
	'enemy.'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'We are esteemed Helman'
	R
	'soldiers. Even if we die for'
	R
	'our country, that is simply'
	R
	'our fate.'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'For the country, and for the'
	R
	'people, throw away your lives.'
	R
	'That is true chivalry!'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'When Leazas attacks, we’ll'
	R
	'face them head on and defeat'
	R
	'them!'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	!VAR0516 : 26!
	\L_00eb5:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'Please stop this, General Nero.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s that?'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'I can’t approve of your'
	R
	'methods any longer. You’re'
	R
	'making piles of corpses for'
	R
	'nothing.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'General Nero, I don’t know if'
	R
	'your plan is chivalrous or not,'
	R
	'but all you do is charge.'
	R
	'Charge, charge, charge...'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'We’re not fighting a war in'
	R
	'the Stone Age. Should we not'
	R
	'fight with all we have and'
	R
	'minimize our casualties?'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e29:
	ZH 1:
	'Nero paced up to Cream and...'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'  ＜ptshhh）'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'...smacked her on the cheek.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'...!'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e99:
	ZH 1:
	'The force of the smack brought'
	R
	'Cream to the floor. She glared'
	R
	'at Nero with stern eyes'
	R
	'despite it.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'Do you think you have the'
	R
	'right to tell me, your'
	R
	'superior, a general, how to do'
	R
	'things?!'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'Then please take fighting more'
	R
	'seriously!'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you even thinking about'
	R
	'how many of our allies have'
	R
	'died due to your plans?!'
	R
	'All the expenses, too?!'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'Your futile plans don’t just'
	R
	'waste human lives, they waste'
	R
	'money as well!'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'Those are funds that are'
	R
	'pressured out of our needy'
	R
	'civilians!'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s natural that they should'
	R
	'pay us, we protect them!'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'You can’t fight if you concern'
	R
	'yourself with such things!'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re wrong. These things'
	R
	'should mean that you can’t use'
	R
	'these reckless charges that'
	R
	'you always do!'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'Fussing over these minor'
	R
	'details is very womanly, Cream.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'Listen to me.'
	R
	'I’m the general of this army.'
	R
	'If you don’t like it, you’re'
	R
	'free to leave.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright!!'
	R
	'The plan will be as I just'
	R
	'announced! I won’t allow any'
	R
	'objections!'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'Everyone, hold chivalry in'
	R
	'your heart and justly destroy'
	R
	'Leazas!!'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	PF1 VAR0056:
	\L_00ec3:
	!VAR0516 : 439!
	\L_00eb5:
	PF0 VAR0056:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'Good god...'
	R
	'What kind of woman is Cream?'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'I agree. If she’s a woman, she'
	R
	'has to be able to be like a'
	R
	'woman and listen quietly to'
	R
	'what you say.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e29:
	ZH 1:
	'Nero spoke with his most'
	R
	'obedient subordinates.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'Ganoblade just doesn’t'
	R
	'understand a knight’s fight'
	R
	'for their general. That’s'
	R
	'where her problems start.'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'War isn’t something that’s'
	R
	'simply to be won.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'Very true...'
	R
	'But...'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'It would be a problem if we'
	R
	'just left her alone.'
	R
	'She’s interfering with the'
	R
	'army’s discipline.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, that’s true.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'But she’s an elite officer'
	R
	'appointed by our country, so I'
	R
	'can’t so simply dispose of her,'
	R
	'either...'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'General, leave it to me.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'What will you do?'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'All sorts of things might'
	R
	'happen on the battlefield.'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'For example...'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'If Ganoblade was assaulted by'
	R
	'the enemy... Or some such'
	R
	'thing...'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00df1:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm...'
	\L_00f16:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s say I didn’t hear that.'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
	\L_00e61:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Of course...'
	\L_00f16:
	\L_00f09:
