		!VAR0516 : 26!
		\L_00e45:
		\L_00e29:
		ZH 1:
		'Cream was sitting in front of'
		R
		'the general’s desk, staring'
		R
		'closely at a map.'
		\L_00f16:
		ZH 1:
		'Cream had, as the lieutenant'
		R
		'general, inherited General'
		R
		'Nero’s position after he was'
		R
		'gone.'
		\L_00f16:
		\L_00f09:
		\L_00e0d:
		ZH 1:
		'It finally happened.'
		R
		'We’ve lost a considerable'
		R
		'number of our troops, but the'
		R
		'fight isn’t over yet...'
		\L_00f16:
		ZH 1:
		'I’ll show them I can turn this'
		R
		'around somehow with my'
		R
		'strategies.'
		\L_00f16:
		ZH 1:
		'I won’t use such single-minded,'
		R
		'thoughtless plans where we'
		R
		'just charge and get killed'
		R
		'over and over like Nero...'
		\L_00f16:
		ZH 1:
		'I’ll win more naturally, by'
		R
		'using our people, minimizing'
		R
		'casualties, and finding'
		R
		'victory and profit for Helman.'
		\L_00f16:
		ZH 1:
		'The day where I realize the'
		R
		'strategies Nero stomped all'
		R
		'over has come... I’m so glad...'
		R
		'I’ll do my best.'
		\L_00f16:
		ZH 1:
		'Yes... Even women can do it'
		R
		'when they get to... But not'
		R
		'like General Mineva...'
		R
		'My own way...'
		\L_00f16:
		\L_00f09:
		\L_00e29:
		ZH 1:
		'While it was only temporary,'
		R
		'Nero’s death gave Cream full'
		R
		'control of the 4th Army. She'
		R
		'was brimming with motivation.'
		\L_00f16:
